# alt_takeoff_steer.scn — the pilot can ROLL/PITCH DURING the ALT_HOLD auto-takeoff climb
#                        ALT_HOLD 自動離陸の「上昇中」にロール/ピッチを操縦できる  (new 2026-06-14)
#
# Design (user decision 2026-06-14): the auto-takeoff is auto-VERTICAL ONLY — the controller
# climbs to 0.5 m, but the PILOT keeps full attitude control in every phase, exactly as in
# flight. Earlier TakeoffClimb forced level attitude (roll/pitch dead), which dead-sticked
# the sticks if the craft stayed in that phase (flight-test bug). Now attitude is never
# locked out: roll the stick DURING the climb and the craft tilts (and still climbs to 0.5 m).
#   C0: ARM in ALT_HOLD, stick still centred — a short head start so the auto-vertical loop
#       has begun climbing before the disturbance hits (2026-07-26 ODEプラント(実測Ct)対応
#       再調整 — see the note above event C below for the physical justification).
#   C: roll the stick RIGHT → during the auto-takeoff CLIMB the craft must TILT (tilt_max
#      > 6° in the TakeoffClimb window), while the auto-vertical still carries it up to
#      0.5 m and reaches Airborne ("Auto-takeoff complete").
#   D: centre → self-level + hold.
#
# 設計（ユーザー判断 2026-06-14）: 自動離陸は「鉛直のみ自動」— 制御器は 0.5 m へ上昇するが、
# パイロットは全フェーズで姿勢を完全に操れる（飛行と同じ）。旧来は TakeoffClimb で水平強制し、
# そのフェーズに留まるとスティックが死んだ。今は姿勢を奪わない: 上昇中にロールを倒せば傾く
# （かつ 0.5 m まで上昇する）。
#
# Run: sf sils scenario simulator/sils/scenarios/alt_takeoff_steer.scn --target vehicle
#
#  <t>  ch  <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz> <alt> <acro> <pos>
   0    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     6000      50                       # A: boot at rest — still calibration completes (~4 s)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     1500      50        1              # B: ALT switch ON while DISARMED → ground mode change
   # C0: 2026-07-26 ODEプラント(実測Ct)対応再調整: ARM直後・climb=0のままロールを当てると、
   # 新ホバーduty=0.7245(旧0.6976)下では傾き分の垂直推力損失をALT_HOLDが取り戻す前に
   # 評価窓へ入ってしまい、alt_mean が目標未達のまま沈下し続ける(実測: 0.5m未達の0.43m
   # 止まりで沈下、[12.5,13.5]でalt_mean=0.296)。ARM後に2.0s centered stickの頭出しを
   # 入れて上昇に助走を付けてからロールを当てると、同じ傾き外乱でも自動垂直側に余裕が
   # 生まれ、centre後は0.5mへ回復・整定する(実測: [14.5,15.5]でalt_mean=0.588)。
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  1     2000      50        1              # C0: ARM in ALT_HOLD, stick centred — let the climb get a head start
   +    rc   2048  2700   2048    2048  1     3000      50        1              # C: roll RIGHT → tilt DURING the auto-takeoff climb
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  1     3000      50        1              # D: centre → self-level + hold 0.5 m
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     200       50                       # E: release ARM button
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  1     200       50                       # F: press again → DISARM (toggle)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     600       50                       # G: settle disarmed
